WEBVTT

0
00:00:10.250 --> 00:00:11.250
Convergent Journalism coursework

1
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.250
Convergent Journalism coursework

2
00:00:13.250 --> 00:00:15.250
Along a street you can walk in five minutes,

3
00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:18.250
stands a barbershop open for over half a century.

4
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:20.250
A photo studio, a tailor and a key-cutting shop.

5
00:00:20.250 --> 00:00:21.250
A photo studio, a tailor and a key-cutting shop.

6
00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:26.250
Sandun Barbershop is the oldest in Sandun.

7
00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:27.250
Passed down through generations,

8
00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:30.250
its history adds up to a century.

9
00:00:30.250 --> 00:00:34.250
Its present owners are Chen Liying and Sun Yiquan.

10
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:40.250
Sun Yiquan, 67, has cut hair in Sandun for over 53 years.

11
00:00:40.250 --> 00:00:44.250
Chen Liying, 62, has been a barber for 43 years.

12
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:46.250
My name is Chen Liying.

13
00:00:46.250 --> 00:00:49.250
This shop has been open for more than fifty years.

14
00:00:49.250 --> 00:00:51.250
I have been doing this for over forty years.

15
00:00:51.250 --> 00:00:52.250
I like this line of work.

16
00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:53.250
Why?

17
00:00:53.250 --> 00:00:55.250
I liked doing my own hair.

18
00:00:55.250 --> 00:00:56.250
How could I do it? I thought, if I worked in a barbershop,

19
00:00:56.250 --> 00:00:57.250
How could I do it? I thought, if I worked in a barbershop,

20
00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:59.250
I could do it myself.

21
00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:02.250
Both have reached retirement age,

22
00:01:02.250 --> 00:01:04.250
but cannot leave their customers of several decades.

23
00:01:05.250 --> 00:01:07.250
They decided to keep working,

24
00:01:08.250 --> 00:01:09.250
until Sandun Old Street is redeveloped.

25
00:01:09.250 --> 00:01:10.250
Until Sandun Old Street is redeveloped.

26
00:01:10.250 --> 00:01:11.250
Older customers

27
00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:13.250
like to have a shave,

28
00:01:13.250 --> 00:01:15.250
so they come to us.

29
00:01:15.250 --> 00:01:16.250
Other places do not offer shaving.

30
00:01:17.250 --> 00:01:19.250
We do it for our longstanding customers,

31
00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:21.250
who have come for decades.

32
00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:23.250
We would not want a friend to come all this way for nothing.

33
00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:25.250
For more than ten years,

34
00:01:25.250 --> 00:01:28.250
a haircut has remained RMB 20.

35
00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:31.250
We do not raise it. It stays the same all year.

36
00:01:31.250 --> 00:01:32.250
That is the price.

37
00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:35.250
When young people come for a haircut,

38
00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:38.250
Ms Chen has her own thoughts.

39
00:01:38.250 --> 00:01:39.250
What if they do not like it?

40
00:01:39.250 --> 00:01:42.250
We tell them this is a place for older people.

41
00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:45.250
If you want a younger style,

42
00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:46.250
go somewhere else.

43
00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.250
We tell them that directly.

44
00:01:49.250 --> 00:01:52.250
I started cutting hair very young, at thirteen.

45
00:01:53.250 --> 00:01:54.250
It was my grandmother

46
00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:56.250
who told my mother—

47
00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:58.250
there were many brothers in our family—

48
00:01:58.250 --> 00:02:03.250
that learning a trade would put food on the table.

49
00:02:03.250 --> 00:02:04.250
Grandmother said a trade would put food on the table.

50
00:02:04.250 --> 00:02:05.250
But which trade?

51
00:02:06.250 --> 00:02:07.250
My grandmother said,

52
00:02:07.250 --> 00:02:08.250
generally,

53
00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:10.250
carpentry

54
00:02:10.250 --> 00:02:11.250
and bricklaying

55
00:02:11.250 --> 00:02:14.250
require a three-year apprenticeship.

56
00:02:15.250 --> 00:02:17.250
But barbering

57
00:02:17.250 --> 00:02:18.250
needs only one year.

58
00:02:18.250 --> 00:02:19.250
One year is enough.

59
00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:20.250
A simple men’s haircut

60
00:02:20.250 --> 00:02:21.250
A simple men’s haircut

61
00:02:21.250 --> 00:02:24.250
can take Mr Sun over half an hour.

62
00:02:24.250 --> 00:02:27.250
They come because we take care.

63
00:02:27.250 --> 00:02:31.250
If you rush through it carelessly,

64
00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:32.250
if you are that sloppy,

65
00:02:32.250 --> 00:02:33.250
they will not come back.

66
00:02:33.250 --> 00:02:35.250
4:38 p.m.

67
00:02:36.250 --> 00:02:39.250
With the shop quiet, Ms Chen packs up and goes home.

68
00:02:40.250 --> 00:02:44.250
At 4:44 p.m., Mr Sun finishes his final customer,

69
00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:46.250
and chats with a visitor.

70
00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:50.250
Then he clears away the day’s hair clippings,

71
00:02:51.250 --> 00:02:52.250
washes the used towels,

72
00:02:52.250 --> 00:02:54.250
and puts everything back inside.

